{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"d83adc4cb7004ae9a3fa58cd24da6c51","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"5b08513da1035a4586aba7ea05cb5ff0a1f6","content_type":1,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=5b08513da1035a4586aba7ea05cb5ff0a1f6","view_num":6976,"pub_timestamp":"1670414460","title":"12월 8일(목) 업데이트 관련 FAQ 안내","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=5b08513da1035a4586aba7ea05cb5ff0a1f6","content":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"84819917b72849fde67747fad73bb615\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e친애하는 지휘관님,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e12월 8일(목)의 업데이트 점검이 시작될 예정이며,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e서버 점검 진행 중에는 게임 접속이 불가한 점 양해 부탁드리겠습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e추가로, 이번 업데이트 이후 발생할 수 있는 몇 가지 문제와 해결 방법을\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e아래와 같이 안내해 드리니 참고하여 확인해 주시길 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eQ1. 로그인이 안 됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e이메일 로그인 이외의 방법을 사용할 경우, 로그인이 원활하지 않을 수 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e정상적으로 첫 로그인을 진행하셨을 경우 이메일 연동을 꼭 진행해 주시기 바라며,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e로그인 불가 현상이 발생할 시 연동하셨던 이메일로 로그인을 시도해 주시길 부탁드립니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e■ 게임 내 계정 연동 방법: 우측 상단 메뉴 \u0026gt; 계정 \u0026gt; 계정 연동\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e혹여 로그인이 가능하지 않다면 아래 안내된 방법을 시도해 주시길 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1) 안정적인 네트워크 환경(wifi/LTE/5G 등)으로 변경 후, 다시 한번 로그인을 시도해 주시기 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2) 이메일 또는 게스트 계정 이외의 방법으로 로그인할 경우, 구글 브라우저를 설치한 후 시도해 주시기 바랍니다.(로그인을 희망하시는 계정의 플랫폼 브라우저도 함께 설치 부탁드립니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3) 트위터에서 지속적으로 로그인이 불가한 현상이 발생할 경우 트위터 백그라운드에서 발생한 문제일 수 있으니 다시 한번 시도해 주시길 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e혹여 여러 차례 시도했음에도 동일한 현상이 발생할 경우 고객센터로 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e👉 \u0026lt;승리의 여신: 니케\u0026gt; 고객센터 문의 방법\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e- \u003ca href=\"https://game.naver.com/lounge/nikke/board/detail/727965\"\u003ehttps://game.naver.com/lounge/nikke/board/detail/727965\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e현재 트위터와 함께 로그인 불가 현상을 해결하기 위해 노력하고 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1.3 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eQ2. 업데이트 후 계정 분실 및 게임이 초기화됐습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e업데이트로 인해 계정이 분실되지 않으니 안심해 주시길 바라며,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e아래의 내용을 보시고 업데이트 이전에 사용하신 계정 정보와 일치한 지 확인해 주시길 바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e■ 계정 분실 관련 확인 요청사항\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e1) 동일 플랫폼의 다른 계정으로 로그인했는지 확인\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e2) 기존 계정과 다른 서버를 선택했는지 확인\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e3) 기존 계정과 다른 플랫폼으로 로그인했는지 확인\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-spacing-before-3pt pap-spacing-after-3pt\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left pap-line-1 pap-line-rule-auto pap-s